="News" /></entry><entry><title>US orders some diplomats to leave Saudi Arabia amid Houthi threat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c8e0eeb885528d7be38e4c46ad1e83d096404c73b4b9635da09a81ab971bac17</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:05:02Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T01:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-orders-some-diplomats-to-leave-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-threat/a-79727353--5b66ad944bdc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-orders-some-diplomats-to-leave-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-threat/a-79727353?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US State Department has asked some US diplomats to leave Saudi Arabia because of the threat of Houthi attacks on the Gulf kingdom.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo will not need further cancer treatment — Vatican</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b144b754cfa429672d09337dea11d8a1d5b5c9bb1e5925ea7354d8d0f2e4ac54</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:05:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T23:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-will-not-need-further-cancer-treatment-vatican/a-79727154--26d8f3c3281e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-will-not-need-further-cancer-treatment-vatican/a-79727154?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo's lung cancer surgery last week was a success, the Vatican said. The pope broke with traditions of secrecy around papal health issues after announcing he needed surgery to remove a nodule on his lung.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German youth plan France-style mass protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0c0ea145d8793a85b2746be2fb8a00f9bf568f2afb8766d2af48cbc93f8cc2fa</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:05:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T23:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-youth-plan-france-style-mass-protests/a-79727133--417332c907b