in to talk to developers and investors. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump, Putin and Xi at one table, without Ukraine. What Moscow wants from the proposal and why Beijing might agree.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:112c71b2d54cbdd2e06023619748a898dcc38cda777c17b9d980d4177d1a2b06</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:03:59Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T19:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-putin-and-xi-at-one-table-without-ukraine-what-moscow-wants-from-the-proposal-and-why-beijing-/a-79726190--eeff17927fb3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-putin-and-xi-at-one-table-without-ukraine-what-moscow-wants-from-the-proposal-and-why-beijing-might-agree/a-79726190?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Moscow is pushing for a summit with Donald Trump and Xi Jinping to discuss ending the war in Ukraine, without Kyiv or the EU. What does Russia hope to gain, and why might China be willing to take part?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Meta ordered to pay $25 billion in Cambridge Analytica case</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c6f75d9bd4c23be74a8e2a8768f034ea4df2de9029b1e7bb3340581ff25f7c8d</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:03:59Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T19:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/meta-ordered-to-pay-25-billion-in-cambridge-analytica-case/a-79726486--b8819bb1d1ae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/meta-ordered-to-pay-25-billion-in-cambridge-analytica-case/a-79726486?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A New Mexico judge ordered Facebook's parent company, Meta, to pay $25 billion for misleading users over the Cambridge Analytica breach, which took place during Donald Trump's first presidential campaign.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>PHP developers say key patches available after global scare</title><id>