nce in Afghanistan comes under strain, India is rebuilding ties with the Taliban in Kabul. Can New Delhi turn this diplomatic opening into lasting strategic gains?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>UK approves Jackdaw gas field after years in limbo</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a333d453ccf3cb906a0cfed507001bb30e2f233ac28e699456631578668885fe</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:03:59Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T09:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-approves-jackdaw-gas-field-after-years-in-limbo/a-79720557--b9a9f932ca8d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-approves-jackdaw-gas-field-after-years-in-limbo/a-79720557?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Drilling is set to begin in the controversial North Sea plot as the government seeks to tackle high energy costs. Environmental groups have criticized the move and called for more clean energy.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US sanctions target Iran's rail sector as Tehran shifts cargo from sea routes to overland corridors</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:daeb09b4f13703bcaafd2f120941e93b521b46aacdac3a82f5e441ac3ed09ed8</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:03:59Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T08:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-target-iran-s-rail-sector-as-tehran-shifts-cargo-from-sea-routes-to-overland-corridors/a-79681413--6d742d0c6640.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-target-iran-s-rail-sector-as-tehran-shifts-cargo-from-sea-routes-to-overland-corridors/a-79681413?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As US sanctions expand to Iran's rail sector, Tehran is relying more heavily on overland links with China and Central Asia. But capacity constraints, delays and costs limit rail's ability to replace maritime trade.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Australi